WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:02.539
Export tables to CSV

2
00:00:02.539 --> 00:00:14.614
Open a workflow note that has a results table

3
00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:20.641
Run Export tables to CSV from the palette

4
00:00:20.641 --> 00:00:23.863
Each table in the saved note gets a CSV

5
00:00:23.863 --> 00:00:32.003
A missing blank line holds the existing CSVs

6
00:00:32.003 --> 00:00:37.499
Preview the locations and add the blank lines

7
00:00:37.499 --> 00:00:51.022
A marker inside a table stops export before any file changes
